content:
The issue is that the `TestMax` method body is disconnected from its declaration. The `{...}` block appears after `TestMaxAlgebra`'s closing brace instead of being attached to `TestMax`.

@@ method TestMax(a: int, b: int) @@
+ {
+   var result := Max(a, b);
+   assert result == a || result == b;
+   assert result >= a && result >= b;
+ }
@@ {
= var result := Max(a, b);
- assert result == a || result == b;
- assert result >= a && result >= b;
- }
